[issue.1667]
number = 1667
title = "[P2] Initialize V6 genesis when recording all vectors"
revision = "bb8caac8b3e73e3e2f4b330805574f0bcb540641"
verdict = "task"
evidence = "The explicit-only V6 setup introduced by commit 172281ea8647e485da37881ba884b06689110239 remains at daemon/committed-fixture/main.go:113 despite the empty default at main.go:90 and all-vector dispatch at main.go:169 selecting the unconditionally registered V6 at daemon/committed-fixture/vector_v6.go:120, whose genesis editor installs token code at vector_v6.go:154 and recorder mints at vector_v6.go:343 before sponsored repayment requires a 32-byte true result at contracts/src/BatchCallAndSponsor.sol:163, while modules/evm/types/genesis.go:11 supplies no code, daemon/committed-fixture/vector_v2.go:531 configures activation rather than token code, and daemon/committed-fixture/vector_v6_test.go:55 installs the runtime directly without exercising CLI selection."
close_comment = "Recording all vectors selects V6 but omits the token runtime required for its sponsored binding transaction. A follow-up fix will initialize V6 genesis for both all-vector and explicit V6 recording before peer startup and add regression coverage for both selections."

